    <briefdescription>
<para>SPI configuration structure for ESP32. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default <computeroutput>host</computeroutput> is selected per build target so the example matches the real wiring on each board:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ESP32-C6 dev kit : SPI2_HOST (only general-purpose host on C6).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ESP32-S3 Flux V1 : SPI3_HOST (shared with MAX22200 via GPIO matrix on GPIO35-38; SPI2 is reserved for the ADS7952 on its IOMUX pins). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
